From be483360039fa7af368a498d6e0c16b67d137b09 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scott van Kalken <svankalken@launchdarkly.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 11:29:34 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] Add player login screen to capture callsign

Adds an arcade-style login overlay that captures the player's name
before the game starts. The callsign is sanitised, shown in the HUD,
persisted to localStorage (pre-filled for returning pilots), and used
as the LaunchDarkly context key so flags can target per-player.

The login overlay is hidden in markup and revealed deterministically at
the start of init(), so it never flashes on a control/disabled path, and
restartGame() dismisses it so a game can't start behind it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 invaders.html | 144 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 141 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

